==============================================================================
  Mutation tests  (assertion-strength validation)
==============================================================================

  Strategy: replace each named fact's body with `{}` (no constraint),
  then re-run Alloy. Each listed assertion should now FAIL on the
  mutated model. If it still PASSes, the assertion is vacuous and
  must be strengthened.

  - MUTATE F_PermissionMatrix  → runs/A-L2/mutated_F_PermissionMatrix.als
    rationale: Clearing the permission matrix body leaves PermMatrix.Allowed unconstrained, allowing Alloy to assign any set of (Role, OperationKind) pairs. The injected violation forces ComplianceReviewer to have DecideApplication, directly breaking LeastPrivilege and FR_004/FR_023 assertions.
    expected to FAIL: LeastPrivilege, FR_002_CustomerPermissions, FR_003_LoanOfficerPermissions, FR_004_ComplianceReviewerPermissions, FR_023_ComplianceReadOnly, PermissionCompleteness
      - LeastPrivilege: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_002_CustomerPermissions: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_003_LoanOfficerPermissions: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_004_ComplianceReviewerPermissions: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_023_ComplianceReadOnly: PASS (vacuous?)
      - PermissionCompleteness: PASS (vacuous?)

  - MUTATE F_OneInFlightPerCustomer  → runs/A-L2/mutated_F_OneInFlightPerCustomer.als
    rationale: Clearing the one-in-flight constraint allows a customer to have two Submitted applications simultaneously. The injection forces exactly that scenario, which FR_008_OneInFlightPerCustomer and ConcurrencySafety must detect.
    expected to FAIL: FR_008_OneInFlightPerCustomer, ConcurrencySafety
      - FR_008_OneInFlightPerCustomer: FAIL (expected)
      - ConcurrencySafety: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_DeciderIsAssignedOfficer  → runs/A-L2/mutated_F_DeciderIsAssignedOfficer.als
    rationale: Clearing this fact decouples the deciding officer from the assigned officer. The injection creates a Decision where decidedBy differs from the application's assignedOfficer, directly violating FR_013 and AttributionCorrectness.
    expected to FAIL: FR_013_OnlyAssignedOfficerDecides, AttributionCorrectness, ValidationBeforeMutation
      - FR_013_OnlyAssignedOfficerDecides: FAIL (expected)
      - AttributionCorrectness: FAIL (expected)
      - ValidationBeforeMutation: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_UniqueInitialAuditEntry  → runs/A-L2/mutated_F_UniqueInitialAuditEntry.als
    rationale: Clearing uniqueness of the initial audit entry allows duplicate (null→Submitted) entries for the same application. The injection forces two such entries to exist, violating FR_019, AppendOnly, and FR_018.
    expected to FAIL: FR_009_AuditOnSubmission, FR_019_ExactlyOneAuditPerTransition, AppendOnly, FR_018_AppendOnlyAudit
      - FR_009_AuditOnSubmission: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_019_ExactlyOneAuditPerTransition: FAIL (expected)
      - AppendOnly: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_018_AppendOnlyAudit: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_AtMostOneDecisionPerApplication  → runs/A-L2/mutated_F_AtMostOneDecisionPerApplication.als
    rationale: Clearing this fact allows two Decision rows for the same application. The injection forces exactly two decisions on the same application, which FR_015 and FR_016 must catch because the state machine guarantees at most one terminal decision.
    expected to FAIL: FR_015_AtomicDecisionRecord, FR_016_TerminalStateImmutability, AuditCompleteness
      - FR_015_AtomicDecisionRecord: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_016_TerminalStateImmutability: PASS (vacuous?)
      - AuditCompleteness: PASS (vacuous?)

  - MUTATE F_AuditActorRolesMatchTransition  → runs/A-L2/mutated_F_AuditActorRolesMatchTransition.als
    rationale: Clearing this fact allows a Customer-role user to be the actor on a claim or decision audit entry, breaking attribution and FR-021. The injection forces a Customer actor on an UnderReview transition entry.
    expected to FAIL: AttributionCorrectness, FR_021_OfficerIdentityHiddenFromCustomer, FR_017_AuditForEveryTransition
      - AttributionCorrectness: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_021_OfficerIdentityHiddenFromCustomer: PASS (vacuous?)
      - FR_017_AuditForEveryTransition: PASS (vacuous?)

